--
^warning: ignoring
--
CBMC reported "template scope 'Tr' not found": with two or more packs,
template_mapt::build kept the deduction-time pack bindings and bound
nothing positionally, so the explicitly specified Tr was never bound,
although the parameters before the first pack correspond to the leading
arguments one to one ([temp.arg.general]/1).  libc++'s
__tuple_sfinae_base::__do_test has this shape.  g++ 13 and clang++ 18
accept this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
